#: org.kde.konquest.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Konquest is a version of Gnu-Lactic Konquest. Players conquer other planets by sending ships to them. The goal is to build an interstellar empire and ultimately conquer all other player's planets."
msgstr "Konquest je inačica igre Gnu-Lactic Konquest. Igrači osvajaju druge planete slanjem brodova na njih. Cilj je izgraditi međuzvjezdano carstvo i naposljetku osvojiti sve planete ostalih igrača."
